- "dry-run detects stale heartbeat" 
- "summary shows found count"
- "summary shows --force hint"

**These tests were NOT modified by the agent** (git diff confirms sw-cleanup-test.sh unchanged). These are **pre-existing failures** unrelated to the policy engine implementation.

### ✅ **ACCEPTABLE CODE QUALITY**

- Follows all project conventions (set -euo pipefail, error traps, init-time loading pattern)
- Consistent with existing shell script style
- Well-structured functions with clear separation of concerns
- Proper use of jq for JSON validation instead of shell gymnastics

